# Deliberate exception: a tiny (~6 KB), hand-built regression fixture, not
# real sequencing data — needed to test align_modbam's length-filter logic.
!tests/fixtures/align_modbam/minireads.fastq

# Deliberate exception: ~120 KB of 4 kb synthetic or PubMLST-derived ospA windows
